{"id":"1fd3a0e014d33285","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-composition-operator.md","title":"Composition Operator","display":"df-composition-operator — Composition Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-composition-operator","aliases":["90-df-composition-operator"],"display":"df-composition-operator — Composition Operator","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-composition-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-composition-operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-composition-operator — Composition Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(k,m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathbb N^m\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\mathbb N^m\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_1,\\ldots,h_m:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(h_1,\\ldots,h_m:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为全函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}\">\\(\\operatorname{Comp}\\)</span> 的函数词汇仅在上述正元数、类型相容的参数域上引入；其定义图与唯一性在 Assertion 中给出。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)\n\\coloneqq\\{(\\vec x,z)\\in\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N:\nz=g(h_1(\\vec x),\\ldots,h_m(\\vec x))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Comp}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)\n\\coloneqq\\{(\\vec x,z)\\in\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N:\nz=g(h_1(\\vec x),\\ldots,h_m(\\vec x))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{Comp}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m):\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\left[f=\\operatorname{Comp}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\ f(\\vec x)=g(h_1(\\vec x),\\ldots,h_m(\\vec x))\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{Comp}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m):\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\left[f=\\operatorname{Comp}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\ f(\\vec x)=g(h_1(\\vec x),\\ldots,h_m(\\vec x))\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留外函数在前、内函数在后的参数顺序。用函数图引入复合，而不使用未定义的 lambda 抽象。保留原正元数输入域，不为归一化约定而向此算子增加零元调用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"k,m\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\mathbb N^m\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"h_1,\\ldots,h_m:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comp}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)\n\\coloneqq\\{(\\vec x,z)\\in\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N:\nz=g(h_1(\\vec x),\\ldots,h_m(\\vec x))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\operatorname{Comp}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m):\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N,\\\\\n&\\forall f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\left[f=\\operatorname{Comp}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\ f(\\vec x)=g(h_1(\\vec x),\\ldots,h_m(\\vec x))\\right].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1238,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6b94974722658c7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6198f000bea16af4","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Z,S,\\pi_i^n$ 见 [[90-df-zero-function]]、[[90-df-successor-function]]、[[90-df-projection-function]]；$Z$ 仍为一元零函数。$\\mathrm{Closure}$ 见 [[90-df-closure-operator]]。复合与原始递归见 [[90-df-composition-operator]]、[[90-df-primrec-operator]]；$\\mathcal O_{\\mathrm{PR}}$ 是 [[90-df-primitive-recursive]] 已定义的、在类型不相容输入上返回 $Z$ 的全算子族。$f$ 为候选有限元数值全函数。此处保留本册的 $\\mathrm{Base},\\mathrm{PR}$ 名称和同一正元基底。"},{"id":"220648f3ca864e2c","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Comp}$ (composition operator, see [[90-df-composition-operator]])"},{"id":"26d87d9e35a83cd9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-composition-operator]] — 复合算子"},{"id":"88d284a5e496e4ef","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Comp}$ (composition operator, see [[90-df-composition-operator]])"},{"id":"93165ca56749f325","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal F,\\mathrm{PR},Z,S,\\pi_i^k$ 取 [[90-df-primitive-recursive]]；$\\operatorname{Comp},\\operatorname{PrimRec}$ 取 [[90-df-composition-operator]]、[[90-df-primrec-operator]]。"},{"id":"abc082683aa1de80","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Comp}$ 取 [[90-df-composition-operator]]，只在正元数相容参数上应用；$\\operatorname{PrimRec}$ 取 [[90-df-primrec-operator]]，递归参数位于最后。"},{"id":"1e6602d1acf4aceb","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-composition-operator]]、[[90-df-primrec-operator]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.